bar / Filter:</strong> Any time you type while the alt tab window is open it automatically begins typing in the searchbar. This acts as a filter (i.e. typing &quot;Th&quot; would filter to windows like &quot;Theme Editor&quot;). For DLC owners, the search bar doubles as an app launcer, using the same apps you have registered with the app launcher itself.  <br><strong>Tags</strong> may also be applied to any &quot;App item&quot; (i.e. &quot;Game&quot;) and will be included in search filtering  <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798470/extras/362d2540837a1bd3b9f1ad068e079e19.avif?t=1768666914\" width=262 height=96 /></span><br>   <br><strong>Highly Customizable UI:</strong> Precisely control the size, spacing, and flow of application windows within the switcher to create the perfect layout for your workflow.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   <br><strong>Blacklist Support:</strong> Hide certain windows from appearing in your Alt Tab window at all! (Toggleable)   <br> <strong> </strong> <br><strong>Lock / Toggle Alt Tab Window:</strong> Option to make the alt tab window &quot;toggle on&quot; instead of staying visible only while alt is held.</p>","developers":["Hex Coded LLC"],"dlc":[3949260],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Design & Illustration","id":"53"},{"description":"Utilities","id":"57"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798470/8148effdfe906a07c8c0ba31d3237cb6e0ed8840/header.jpg?t=1768666914","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_